(QUADRATIC EQUATIONS) Tj T*
(Standard form: ax^2 + bx + c = 0, with a not equal to 0.) Tj T*
(Quadratic formula: x = \(-b +/- sqrt\(b^2 - 4ac\)\) / 2a) Tj T*
(Discriminant D = b^2 - 4ac:) Tj T*
(  D > 0 two real roots; D = 0 one repeated root; D < 0 no real roots.) Tj T*
(Sum of roots = -b/a; product of roots = c/a.) Tj T*
