(ALGEBRAIC IDENTITIES) Tj T*
(\(a + b\)^2 = a^2 + 2ab + b^2) Tj T*
(\(a - b\)^2 = a^2 - 2ab + b^2) Tj T*
(a^2 - b^2 = \(a + b\)\(a - b\)) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(TRIGONOMETRY) Tj T*
(sin^2 x + cos^2 x = 1) Tj T*
(tan x = sin x / cos x) Tj T*
(For a right triangle: sin = opposite/hypotenuse, cos = adjacent/hypotenuse.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(MENSURATION) Tj T*
(Circle: area = pi r^2, circumference = 2 pi r.) Tj T*
(Cylinder: volume = pi r^2 h, curved surface = 2 pi r h.) Tj T*
